step	32	-	Quick guide step 32
line	<str>To begin speak to Elena in East Ardougne (directly west of shortcut log).</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Jerico in the house just south of the northern Ardougne bank (The house with pigeon cages in the backyard).</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the cupboard to obtain bird feed (click continue or the bird feed won't be added to your inventory).</str>
line	
line	<str>Grab a pigeon cage from the backyard (note: if you are planning on doing One Small Favour, grab an extra 5 pigeon cages).</str>
line	
line	<str>Go south-west of Ardougne Castle and speak to Omart.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go north to the small watchtower along the wall, in front of the gates to West Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Stand in the corner where the two spiked fences meet.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use bird feed on the watchtower fence.</str>
line	
line	<str>Click open on the pigeon cage in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip your gas mask.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run south from the watchtower and speak to Omart. After a slight delay, you will arrive in West Ardougne.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head around the headquarters to the north-eastern area with the vat and mangle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Squeeze through the fence into the backyard.</str>
line	
line	<str>Pick up the rotten apple.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the rotten apple on the cauldron.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back through the fence.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to Nurse Sarah's house, south-west of the West Ardougne church.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search cupboard in northern part of the house for a medical gown.</str>
line	
line	<str>Equip the medical gown, go back to the headquarters and open the door.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go upstairs and kill a mourner. A key will automatically be placed in your inventory.</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the key on the gate to get into the caged room.</str>
line	
line	<str>Search the crate third from the left on the northern wall to find Elena's distillator.</str>
line	
